### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Register Pasien
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Budi Sehat",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Budi12345"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Budi12345"
}

### Profil - ganti TOKEN
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Daftar anggota
GET http://localhost:3000/api/anggota?q=
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Tambah anggota
POST http://localhost:3000/api/anggota
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_lengkap": "Siti Sehat",
  "hubungan": "ANAK",
  "golongan_darah": "O",
  "tinggi_cm": 120,
  "berat_kg": 25
}

### Daftar faskes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/faskes?q=
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Tambah riwayat alergi
POST http://localhost:3000/api/riwayat
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anggota_id": 1,
  "kategori": "ALERGI",
  "nama": "Debu",
  "tingkat_keparahan": "RINGAN"
}

### Tambah kunjungan
POST http://localhost:3000/api/kunjungan
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "anggota_id": 1,
  "faskes_id": 1,
  "tanggal_kunjungan": "2026-11-01",
  "keluhan": "Demam"
}
